{'symbol': 'XEL', 'date': '2023-02-22 19:40:00', 'title': 'XCEL ENERGY INC. BOARD INCREASES 2023 COMMON DIVIDEND 6.7%, DECLARES DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF XCEL ENERGY INC. (NASDAQ: XEL) TODAY RAISED THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK FROM 48.75 CENTS PER SHARE TO 52 CENTS PER SHARE, WHICH IS EQUIVALENT TO AN ANNUAL RATE OF $2.08 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDENDS ARE PAYABLE APRIL 20, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON MARCH 15, 2023. “SINCE INCREASING OUR DIVIDEND GROWTH OBJECTIVE IN 2015 TO 5-7 PERCENT ANNUALLY, WE HAVE DELIVERED AVERAGE ANNUAL DIVIDEND INCREASES ABOVE 6 PERCENT."}